# BB build flags (ADR-0002 Границы), sourced by the one hook line at the end of
# configs/common/mozconfig. Order in the generated mozconfig: Zen common flags,
# then this file (and mozconfig.macos), then Zen's configs/macos/mozconfig — so
# Zen's macOS flags still come after BB's.
#
# What goes here: release flags (PGO/LTO/SDK) and strip flags (--disable-*,
# MOZ_*=). Who decides them: E0 and ADR-0003.
# Rule: add or override Zen's flags, never copy them.
#
# BB is macOS-only, so the macOS fragment is sourced unconditionally.
. "$topsrcdir/../configs/bb/mozconfig.macos"
